	scott 0 0 0 at 5 55 61 0 sketch-pinnacled-spire
	scott stone-colour keep ;

\ Edinburgh's main streets lined with tenements: the Royal Mile's tall lands, 26 m (an estimate), begun past the castle's esplanade; Princes Street and Queen Street on their north sides only, facing their gardens; George Street, South Bridge, Leith Walk and Lothian Road; St Andrew and Charlotte Squares; Waverley's and Haymarket's train sheds, an estimated 12 and 10 m high; the main-line railways through Princes Street Gardens
