\ Glasgow's main streets, Great Western Road, Argyle Street, Buchanan Street and Sauchiehall Street, lined with tenements 18 m high; George Square with Walter Scott's 80 ft column at its centre; Central and Queen Street stations, their train sheds an estimated 15 and 18 m high; the main-line railways
