\ === Inverness ===

\ Inverness: its main streets lined with buildings an estimated 14 m high; the station's shed, an estimated 10 m; the railways. The castle, the red sandstone of 1836, on its OpenStreetMap footprint on Castle Hill above the Ness: walls an estimated 14 m with a parapet and a round tower at a corner, the hill an estimated 20 m. The cathedral of 1869: its nave, and the two west towers, 30 m, flat-topped with pinnacles because their spires were never built. The Town House of 1882 on its footprint, an estimated 16 m
: build-inverness ( -- )
	{ :academy-street [ 14 [ -1 1 ] ] :high-street [ 14 [ -1 1 ] ] :church-street [ 14 [ -1 1 ] ]
	  :castle-street [ 14 [ -1 1 ] ] :bridge-street [ 14 [ -1 1 ] ] :union-street [ 14 [ -1 1 ] ]
	  :tomnahurich-street [ 14 [ -1 1 ] ] :huntly-street [ 14 [ -1 1 ] ] } to styles
	inverness-streets styles inverness-squares inverness-stations { :inverness 10 } inverness-railways keep-city
	:inverness-castle landmark-ground 150 20 24 keep-hill
	:inverness-castle on-ground second to hill-top
	inverness-buildings@inverness-castle hill-top ground-path to footprint
	new-sketch to castle
	castle footprint 14 sketch-prism
	castle footprint ( point | point [ 0 14 0 ] v+ ) map 2 sketch-prism
	castle footprint first 4 0 22 8 sketch-drum
	castle sandstone-colour keep
	new-sketch to churches
	:inverness-cathedral landmark-ground 0 site!
	churches 0 0 0 at 0 20 50 14 22 sketch-house
	[ -6 6 ] ( across |
		churches -28 across 0 at 0 7 7 30 sketch-box
		churches -28 across 0 at 7 30 30 3 sketch-pinnacled-spire
	) each
	inverness-buildings@inverness-town-house 0 ground-path 16 churches -rot sketch-prism
	churches stone-colour keep
	build-urquhart ;

\ === the north-east and the northern isles ===

0xb4b4bc constant granite-colour

\ a lighthouse on its landmark's ground: a round tower its height high, the lantern on it 4 m high, and the roof's point 2 m above the lantern
: keep-lighthouse ( key height -- )
	| key height |
	key on-ground to foot
	new-sketch to lighthouse
	lighthouse foot 3.5 0 height 10 sketch-drum
	lighthouse foot 2 height height 4 + 8 sketch-drum
	foot [ 0 height 4 + 0 ] v+ 2 0 8 ring-points ( rim | lighthouse [ rim foot [ 0 height 6 + 0 ] v+ ] sketch-path ) each
	lighthouse stone-colour keep ;

\ a frame of the same style for every one of a city's streets
: uniform-styles ( streets style -- styles )
	| streets style |
	{ } to styles
	streets keys ( key | styles style key ! drop ) each
	styles ;

