		0 n-floats 1+ 1 do f
			from onto f n-floats / v-between to float
			sketch [ float first float second 0.5 at float first float second 2 at ] sketch-path
		loop
	loop
	-250 251 50 do along
		sketch along -60 shore-at 1 0 3 6 sketch-drum
	loop
	[ -150 -50 50 150 ] ( along |
		along -100 shore-at to pit
