\ a harbour's piers, quays and breakwaters, each its edge 2 m above the water and a parallel edge 8 m in; on each quay 150 m or longer a portal crane every 80 m with a warehouse behind it, 40 m long, 15 m deep, 8 m to the eaves (heights and crane spacing estimates)
